{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0054_1000_p", "source_sha256": "bdd311eb28bffb616e031576dfab072dad9aa25f794fc313d550f52062b08e38", "ja": "（新年の幕明けを飾る新春ライブ。初詣客で賑わう境内\nでのライブを終えた奈緒は、舞台袖まで戻ってきた）", "zh": "（庆祝新年到来的新春演唱会就办在挤满年初参拜人潮的\n神社内，而奈绪完成表演后也回到舞台侧边。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0054_1001_037nao", "source_sha256": "67c282461fbe0fb2c39c4e0d1c3da6ad03e74a61d1174f79b9a24c55d3217c51", "ja": "{$P$}さん、見ててくれました？\n私、メッチャ頑張ったで！", "zh": "{$P$}先生，你看到我的表现了吗？\n我超努力的啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0054_1002_p", "source_sha256": "aa52441462174bff8b57737f67ed5f56eb3a40d357b2a335c09208e7fe06c470", "ja": "ああ、ちゃんと見てたよ。参拝客も巻き込んで、\nまさにお祭りだったな。文句なしだ！", "zh": "有啊，我看得很仔细。连来参拜的民众都一起参与，\n简直就像祭典一样。太完美了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0054_1003_037nao", "source_sha256": "d4c1d22690ab8b764f9d89ae40e1f39b0aec5c3b42f708f54c99493f801e3006", "ja": "やった！　って、これも{$P$}さんの\nおかげやけど。えへへ、ありがとうな！", "zh": "太好啦！不过，这都多亏了\n{$P$}先生的努力。嘿嘿，谢谢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0054_1004_037nao", "source_sha256": "9a83b173293dc45d2ff0a698b6935b990c4c6a66e8131367ba5ab25fce0ca53e", "ja": "ところで……。\nなぁなぁ、{$P$}さん？", "zh": "对了……\n欸欸，{$P$}先生？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0054_1005_p", "source_sha256": "a4d14b5b7ac5706c12b66bad682c238081555529989aa5ae24f11df9eda9a79d", "ja": "ん？　どうしたんだ？", "zh": "嗯？怎么啦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0054_1006_037nao", "source_sha256": "cb8ddd6e1a5cf63887aba481b3ff90a76c9652dcf022f914f101003511a60d6c", "ja": "頑張ったごほうびってことで～。\nちょっとだけ、ワガママ言うたらあかん？", "zh": "我这么努力应该有奖励吧～\n可以答应我一个任性的小要求吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0054_1007_p", "source_sha256": "6ac25144d8e6139ba247727e7c6a7f2115de33580b05c67c45a9a29e6864e0ce", "ja": "……いいけど、まぁ内容にもよるかな。\nどんなワガママなんだ？", "zh": "……可以是可以，不过还是要看内容吧。\n是什么样的任性要求？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0054_1008_037nao", "source_sha256": "9e48e65c0b09e2d051ec1d71453fd20213ff2ac398371a03b531fd78d7f56b33", "ja": "私も屋台、見てまわりたいんですー！\n{$P$}さん、付き合うてくれません？", "zh": "我也想去逛摊贩！\n{$P$}先生，你可以陪我去吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0054_1009_p", "source_sha256": "8d81c202459e5388f7ac0901be91d9411b9e43d303069e1f7694d2aaf9fc3081", "ja": "なんだ、そんなことか。\n屋台もいいけど、疲れてないのか？", "zh": "什么嘛，原来是这种事。\n要逛是可以，但你不累吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0054_1010_037nao", "source_sha256": "2da0b5e17e5d29ad6ac0bc45906a09e65d91f9f4c2ea8344e2a8b387b3af28e3", "ja": "全然平気やで！\nライブと屋台は別腹です！", "zh": "完全没问题啦！\n演唱会和逛摊贩的精力是分开算的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0054_1011_p", "source_sha256": "d3b3ffefc376936ea718a814b7c966d67060f5331c52d08e339233ed5e7aa32f", "ja": "はは、わかったよ。\nそれじゃ、好きなだけ付き合うとするか！", "zh": "哈哈，好吧。\n那我就奉陪到底吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0054_1012_037nao", "source_sha256": "51734c19c4b9260f34857d826cdd50cc5b28c7e007056e350240553005f8af93", "ja": "よっしゃー！　そうと決まったら、はよ行きましょ！\nとりあえず、わた飴とりんご飴と～♪", "zh": "太好啦！既然决定了，那我们快走吧！\n总之，先去买棉花糖和苹果糖～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0054_1013_p", "source_sha256": "606cc6e374826bebefbfe055dd41fb9e0a455ff665f4c774da6c923899ee3171", "ja": "ちょっと待った！\n衣装のままはダメだぞ。ちゃんと着替えてこないと。", "zh": "等等！\n不能直接穿着表演服装去买，先换下来再说。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0054_1014_037nao", "source_sha256": "f657a93ffd5fd4d9c44785cc648d0d28f68f877218070c092103670a0805e174", "ja": "え～っ！？\nでも、はよ行かな、売り切れてしまうし……。", "zh": "咦～！？\n可是，不快点去的话，就要卖光了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0054_1015_p", "source_sha256": "4d74bfa4fd3c147068b870d5964f0fbd032028b7c15a5fe7a5f8cef85f83cac2", "ja": "ダメダメ。ファンの人たちに囲まれたりしたら、\nそれこそ買い物どころじゃなくなるだろ？", "zh": "不行不行，要是被粉丝们包围，\n到时就真的连买都不用买了吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0054_1016_037nao", "source_sha256": "9a4bb305696f545d5dc0d501b1f0b5eb6e7a12e454af7ba72e2b0c8a442c77b1", "ja": "うう……。{$P$}さん、\nちゃんと待っててくれます？", "zh": "呜呜……{$P$}先生，\n你会等我换好吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0054_1017_p", "source_sha256": "95664fa0c07c4fc2bde5e564269b8abaf6931ed1af02f43a685e2ade3aa44ccd", "ja": "もちろん、待ってるよ。\nだから早く行ってこい。", "zh": "我当然会等你。\n所以你快去换吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0054_1018_037nao", "source_sha256": "819a91ede2d26d7838e4f64b6c389fe7cb74a55b4e0a5760a8a0ee62cdc537fa", "ja": "絶対ですよ？　先に行かんと、ちゃんと待っとってな？\nあ、これフリやないですからね？　ホンマですよ！？", "zh": "一定要等我喔！不可以偷跑，要乖乖等我喔！\n啊，这不是在铺梗喔！我是认真的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
